# 统一按 LF 存储与检出 —— 保证仓库里的字节与开发者工作区完全一致。
# Store and check out everything as LF so the repository bytes match the working tree.
* text=auto eol=lf

# 以下规则顺序在后，覆盖上面的通配；声明为不转换，保持原始字节。
# Rules below come AFTER the catch-all (later rules win) and disable conversion.
*.bat -text
*.exe binary
*.zip binary
*.png binary
*.ico binary
